{"3187120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vitta Lucis", "steam_appid": 3187120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/e35b20907bce1e6679eba39a086b05c5.poster.avif?t=1777678279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/e35b20907bce1e6679eba39a086b05c5.webm?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/e35b20907bce1e6679eba39a086b05c5.mp4?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vitta Lucis is a mercenary from a private church guild, possessing demonic powers. Assemble a squad of Church Demons and embark on a dark fantasy action adventure. Faith in God was partly a mistake - curses, demons, and other evil spirits do exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/ec1654dde7bef31232536f7184b95dd1.poster.avif?t=1777678279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/ec1654dde7bef31232536f7184b95dd1.webm?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/ec1654dde7bef31232536f7184b95dd1.mp4?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat with character switching to use unique abilities at the most critical moment. In battle, you control one hero, while the rest of your squad operate independently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/2c11a6a3b39e00804d11777b672c8626.avif?t=1777678279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras_big/2c11a6a3b39e00804d11777b672c8626.avif?t=1777678279 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of unique mercenaries, each with their own story, motivation, and set of abilities. Experiment with your composition and choose your preferred playstyle to confront evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/0904d42f00d4cb74fc05b3a07bbd6d30.avif?t=1777678279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras_big/0904d42f00d4cb74fc05b3a07bbd6d30.avif?t=1777678279 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grim world on the brink of destruction. Peaceful settlements teem with intrigue and bandits, and the highway is full of monsters and bandits. Return to previously explored locations to find new points of interest, unlock additional quests, and influence the course of the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/a76a7204172f8964a177bef1954e1f88.avif?t=1777678279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras_big/a76a7204172f8964a177bef1954e1f88.avif?t=1777678279 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vitta gained her powers to fight evil against her will. She is the only one who knows her name, as she has begun to remember her past, including the process of forging a contract with the demon imprisoned within the weapon. Uncover the dark secrets of the world to decipher the Prophecy of Oblivion.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/e35b20907bce1e6679eba39a086b05c5.poster.avif?t=1777678279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/e35b20907bce1e6679eba39a086b05c5.webm?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/e35b20907bce1e6679eba39a086b05c5.mp4?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vitta Lucis is a mercenary from a private church guild, possessing demonic powers. Assemble a squad of Church Demons and embark on a dark fantasy action adventure. Faith in God was partly a mistake - curses, demons, and other evil spirits do exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/ec1654dde7bef31232536f7184b95dd1.poster.avif?t=1777678279\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/ec1654dde7bef31232536f7184b95dd1.webm?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/ec1654dde7bef31232536f7184b95dd1.mp4?t=1777678279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat with character switching to use unique abilities at the most critical moment. In battle, you control one hero, while the rest of your squad operate independently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/2c11a6a3b39e00804d11777b672c8626.avif?t=1777678279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras_big/2c11a6a3b39e00804d11777b672c8626.avif?t=1777678279 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a squad of unique mercenaries, each with their own story, motivation, and set of abilities. Experiment with your composition and choose your preferred playstyle to confront evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/0904d42f00d4cb74fc05b3a07bbd6d30.avif?t=1777678279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras_big/0904d42f00d4cb74fc05b3a07bbd6d30.avif?t=1777678279 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grim world on the brink of destruction. Peaceful settlements teem with intrigue and bandits, and the highway is full of monsters and bandits. Return to previously explored locations to find new points of interest, unlock additional quests, and influence the course of the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187120/extras/a76a7204172f8964a177bef1954e1f88.avif?t=1777678279\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.ste